# Gemini CLI environment file — project-scoped.
#
# Per BD-059, AGENT_CAPABILITIES is mirrored across the three tools:
#   - Claude: .claude/settings.json env.AGENT_CAPABILITIES
#   - Codex:  .codex/config.toml [agent_capabilities] table
#   - Gemini: this file (Gemini's settings.json has no env block;
#             env vars flow via .gemini/.env per Gemini CLI docs).
#
# The list below is the canonical pack-wide capability set. Update all
# three tools' configs together (trinity rule for tool-level configuration,
# BD-059 success criterion).

AGENT_CAPABILITIES=planning,architecture,implementation,refactoring,debugging,testing,review,dependency-review,repo-ops,documentation
